# Phase 9/10: browser-assist runtime scratch space
# (app.applications.browser_assist/browser_runtime) -- never persists
# cookies/sessions itself (every browser context is ephemeral, closed at the
# end of every session), but this directory must still never be committed in
# case any temp/download artifact, screenshot, or page snapshot ever lands
# here. Covers both the legacy Phase 9 path and the Phase 10
# BROWSER_RUNTIME_DIR default (same directory), plus the general
# runtime/browser/ path CLAUDE.md's Phase 10 build brief names as an example.
data/browser_assist_runtime/
runtime/

